{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"shield_steel_heater","model_identifier":"shield_steel_heater","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## shield_steel_heater\n\nShield, steel.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.2..1.0, y -15.0..11.0, z -8.5..8.5 (size 2.2 x 26.0 x 17.0 u = 6 x 73 x 48 cm).\nSteel heater shield, about 75 cm tall (26 u) x 17 u: flat top, sides curving in steps to a point, steel rim, a **team-colour field** (RGB 52, 96, 178 placeholder) with a steel bar across the chief and a white pale (vertical stripe). Origin = **slot_shield_l**, face -X. Steel and high-quality steel textures.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `shield_steel_heater_steel.png`, `shield_steel_heater_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## shield_steel_heater\n\nShield, steel.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.2..1.0, y -15.0..11.0, z -8.5..8.5 (size 2.2 x 26.0 x 17.0 u = 6 x 73 x 48 cm).\nSteel heater shield, about 75 cm tall (26 u) x 17 u: flat top, sides curving in steps to a point, steel rim, a **team-colour field** (RGB 52, 96, 178 placeholder) with a steel bar across the chief and a white pale (vertical stripe). Origin = **slot_shield_l**, face -X. Steel and high-quality steel textures.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `shield_steel_heater_steel.png`, `shield_steel_heater_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"board_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,-15.0,-2.0],"to":[0.0,-13.0,2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv"